---
/**
 * An alias for the scan's canonical page, not a second copy of it.
 *
 * The study has been at /research/yc-email-spoofing-study since it was published and is
 * the URL every existing link and citation points at. A second page describing the same
 * 6,157-domain scan under a different slug would be the duplicate this site spent a
 * migration removing — two URLs competing for one set of figures, with the citations
 * split between them.
 *
 * So this alias exists only so the more descriptive slug resolves rather than 404s for
 * anyone who was handed it. It is a permanent redirect, it is absent from the sitemap,
 * and nothing links to it.
 */
return Astro.redirect('/research/yc-email-spoofing-study', 301);
